Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Big Punか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I like both.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}どっちも好き
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Take a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}じゃあ一杯飲め
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:07.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So, you know, God said for us to not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:07.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}神は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:07.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}互いを比べるなって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:10.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}compare each other
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:10.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}amongst ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:10.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}言ってるだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So when I compare the greatness of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}だからKool G Rapの偉大さと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:15.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Kool G Rap and the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:15.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}greatness of Big Pun,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:15.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Big Punの偉大さを比べるのは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}which was inspired by Kool G Rap,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}しかもBig PunはKool G Rapに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}影響受けてるわけで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:18.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:18.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}確かに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}it's not godly. You
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}神の道に反するんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}わかる？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:22.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I know Ross said God forgives,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:22.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}Rick Rossは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:22.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「神は許すが俺は許さない」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:22.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:22.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}言ってたけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:29.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm forgiving. I forgive everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:29.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I forgive the Clintons. I forgive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:29.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺は許す　全員許す　Clinton夫妻も許す
