Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.35,0:00:39.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}あいつは許された
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:49.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Big Sean. May they all be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:49.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}forgiven. I forgive Big Sean
